<Portfolio title="Freelance web designer in Dubai" description="Meet ken.lou, the designer and developer behind Under the Haik. Independent web design and visual identity for small businesses in Dubai and the UAE."><article class="service-document guide-body wrap"><h1>The designer behind Under the Haik</h1><p>Hi, I’m ken.lou, an independent designer and developer based in Dubai. I create websites and starter visual identities for small businesses across the UAE.</p><h2>A design eye and a technical mindset</h2><p>My background is in cybersecurity, systems administration and networking. That helps me consider how a website is hosted, maintained and connected, alongside how it looks and feels to use.</p><h2>Working together</h2><p>You speak directly with the person doing the work. We agree your scope, pages, features, revisions and costs in a written quote. Concepts and family projects are labelled in my portfolio, and client work is identified clearly.</p><p>Every project starts with your business, audience and the action visitors should take. You receive the agreed files, account access and handover guidance when the project is complete.</p></article><PortfolioContact/></Portfolio>
